{
  "bvid": "BV1kEVszWEbm",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "ec3fea26c8803d8bfc093fe1c15845ad9ce90bccbcd578a1dbdef1c33cb4884e",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 220,
      "end_ms": 4019,
      "text": "就是说历史当中是充满了非常诡异的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 4019,
      "end_ms": 8530,
      "text": "但是是是非常巨大的巧合的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 10210,
      "end_ms": 14660,
      "text": "说出来睡不着觉的巧合"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 16920,
      "end_ms": 22840,
      "text": "但是这种巧合肯定是给做好了全然准备的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 22840,
      "end_ms": 27350,
      "text": "或者团体的这些东西又不是呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 27350,
      "end_ms": 28710,
      "text": "没办法和别人说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 28710,
      "end_ms": 30050,
      "text": "这不是运气啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 30050,
      "end_ms": 31850,
      "text": "这都不是运气"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 31850,
      "end_ms": 33010,
      "text": "说不出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 33010,
      "end_ms": 34190,
      "text": "不可能说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 34190,
      "end_ms": 35810,
      "text": "可能过几十年之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 35810,
      "end_ms": 40230,
      "text": "我们团队的发展史里面可能会把它写出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 40230,
      "end_ms": 41710,
      "text": "但是是说不出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 42710,
      "end_ms": 44470,
      "text": "无论如何呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 51420,
      "end_ms": 56700,
      "text": "我们在历史面前保有了全部的尊严啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 56700,
      "end_ms": 61940,
      "text": "也有了就是比较重要的成就"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 62540,
      "end_ms": 66609,
      "text": "这个是呃所有人努力的结果啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 66609,
      "end_ms": 70549,
      "text": "我们这个舵呢我觉得我还是有自信"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 70549,
      "end_ms": 73460,
      "text": "说我没有长歪这个舵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 73860,
      "end_ms": 75980,
      "text": "但是说现在成绩也没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 75980,
      "end_ms": 79900,
      "text": "就是说真的全做出来啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 86440,
      "end_ms": 88920,
      "text": "嗯是好事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 88920,
      "end_ms": 90420,
      "text": "但是不能叫好事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 90420,
      "end_ms": 92040,
      "text": "是一件重要的事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 92040,
      "end_ms": 94560,
      "text": "甚至说是一件很重要的一件事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 98900,
      "end_ms": 101540,
      "text": "这个历史是现实的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 102100,
      "end_ms": 108130,
      "text": "然后呢机会也是现实的各种风险嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 109530,
      "end_ms": 114650,
      "text": "事物的潜在的走向和这个最后的真实的后果"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 114650,
      "end_ms": 116870,
      "text": "这些都是真实的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 128960,
      "end_ms": 130120,
      "text": "哦没有被招安"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 130120,
      "end_ms": 131220,
      "text": "不可能被招安的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 131220,
      "end_ms": 133280,
      "text": "这种事情怎么可能被招安呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 133280,
      "end_ms": 134000,
      "text": "这搞笑呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 134000,
      "end_ms": 135320,
      "text": "绝对不会是被招安的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 136360,
      "end_ms": 137750,
      "text": "做梦的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 144040,
      "end_ms": 146560,
      "text": "但因为这里面是有一种普遍性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 147640,
      "end_ms": 148980,
      "text": "苦心孤诣"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 148980,
      "end_ms": 152160,
      "text": "有一种普遍性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 152160,
      "end_ms": 155220,
      "text": "一个普遍性横亘在历史之中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 155740,
      "end_ms": 159060,
      "text": "这个不会就是简单的讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 159060,
      "end_ms": 163880,
      "text": "他不但会以个人的这个命运来折射"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 163880,
      "end_ms": 164680,
      "text": "它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 164680,
      "end_ms": 173430,
      "text": "会是以这个团队的使命和这个这个使命"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 173430,
      "end_ms": 174790,
      "text": "带动下的活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 174790,
      "end_ms": 182249,
      "text": "他的啊获得了整个世界的这个回应啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 182249,
      "end_ms": 185464,
      "text": "作为一个基本单元而存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 191280,
      "end_ms": 192880,
      "text": "不这不是生存问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 192880,
      "end_ms": 194200,
      "text": "我没说我没有被招安"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 194200,
      "end_ms": 195400,
      "text": "这不是被招安这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 195400,
      "end_ms": 197500,
      "text": "你们说我们被招安了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 197500,
      "end_ms": 199820,
      "text": "这太太太瞧不起我们了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 199820,
      "end_ms": 201640,
      "text": "太太瞧不起我们了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 201640,
      "end_ms": 203320,
      "text": "这种什么被招安不招安"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 203320,
      "end_ms": 206140,
      "text": "这东西根本我不这这不配我来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 206140,
      "end_ms": 208600,
      "text": "我来就比较郑重其事的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 208600,
      "end_ms": 210600,
      "text": "或者他不能激起我的任何的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 211600,
      "end_ms": 215979,
      "text": "对于这个历史的觉知啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 218380,
      "end_ms": 220300,
      "text": "对这是可以说是世界的回应"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 221340,
      "end_ms": 224200,
      "text": "世界的巧合的很荒诞的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 224200,
      "end_ms": 225740,
      "text": "非常巧合的一种回应"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 225740,
      "end_ms": 227080,
      "text": "但是他是回应"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 228880,
      "end_ms": 231260,
      "text": "嗯你们不要不要幻想了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 231260,
      "end_ms": 237450,
      "text": "就是没有办法直接告诉你们这是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 238210,
      "end_ms": 240770,
      "text": "但是你只要你活的时间够长"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 240770,
      "end_ms": 241730,
      "text": "你会活30年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 241730,
      "end_ms": 242130,
      "text": "40年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 242130,
      "end_ms": 243170,
      "text": "你会知道这是什么的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 243170,
      "end_ms": 244370,
      "text": "What it is"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 244370,
      "end_ms": 245970,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 256760,
      "end_ms": 260800,
      "text": "呃我们在生活当中很多事物没有办法控制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 262719,
      "end_ms": 267950,
      "text": "绝大部分的现实就是不按照我们的想法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 267950,
      "end_ms": 270190,
      "text": "在在变化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 275540,
      "end_ms": 276880,
      "text": "能够坚持的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 276880,
      "end_ms": 282960,
      "text": "能够去把握住的只是一些很粗浅的信条信念"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 284120,
      "end_ms": 287470,
      "text": "还有一些嗯目力所及"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 287470,
      "end_ms": 288990,
      "text": "就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 290460,
      "end_ms": 291980,
      "text": "比较狭隘啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 291980,
      "end_ms": 294020,
      "text": "比较这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 297300,
      "end_ms": 302050,
      "text": "比较耳近的这些局部周遭啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 303130,
      "end_ms": 304780,
      "text": "没办法呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 305100,
      "end_ms": 307240,
      "text": "就给了这些东西啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 307240,
      "end_ms": 310540,
      "text": "啊没有办法没有办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 315060,
      "end_ms": 317820,
      "text": "对我们认为我们有一定的成就了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 319260,
      "end_ms": 321280,
      "text": "我们认为我们有一定的成就了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 321280,
      "end_ms": 326940,
      "text": "只是我们认为呃我们至少我们在某种意义上讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 326940,
      "end_ms": 328260,
      "text": "我们自居"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 328260,
      "end_ms": 329480,
      "text": "我们的自居"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 329480,
      "end_ms": 332830,
      "text": "我们的自认是内心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 332830,
      "end_ms": 335730,
      "text": "不再会有任何的自我怀疑和自我犹"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 335730,
      "end_ms": 337950,
      "text": "没有任何的犹豫了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 338729,
      "end_ms": 339609,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 339609,
      "end_ms": 340609,
      "text": "我们不当"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 340609,
      "end_ms": 343449,
      "text": "不再会对于我们自己的内在身份认同"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 343449,
      "end_ms": 346020,
      "text": "会有任何的怀疑和犹豫了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 346060,
      "end_ms": 349620,
      "text": "在这个讲我们是比较幸福的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 350780,
      "end_ms": 352280,
      "text": "我们是非常幸福的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 352280,
      "end_ms": 353770,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 358780,
      "end_ms": 360980,
      "text": "不他不来自于外部的肯定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 360980,
      "end_ms": 362980,
      "text": "不来自于任何团体的肯定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 362980,
      "end_ms": 365390,
      "text": "它来自于历史的肯定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 365390,
      "end_ms": 366350,
      "text": "我们这样说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 366350,
      "end_ms": 369920,
      "text": "我们认为我们被历史肯定了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 370640,
      "end_ms": 373280,
      "text": "我们被历史肯定了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 373280,
      "end_ms": 374240,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 374240,
      "end_ms": 378300,
      "text": "我们被人类的命运呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 378300,
      "end_ms": 382720,
      "text": "发起命运改变的某种历史的契机所肯定了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 385440,
      "end_ms": 388880,
      "text": "嗯这个是嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 389620,
      "end_ms": 393320,
      "text": "这是非常值得我们去骄傲的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 393320,
      "end_ms": 397340,
      "text": "非让我们去思考其中的缘由"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 398800,
      "end_ms": 402680,
      "text": "对一件事情一个重大征兆"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 404400,
      "end_ms": 407320,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 413820,
      "end_ms": 414560,
      "text": "行吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 414560,
      "end_ms": 417060,
      "text": "那反正就讲到这边啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 417060,
      "end_ms": 417860,
      "text": "他们也很累了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 419840,
      "end_ms": 420740,
      "text": "很累了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 420740,
      "end_ms": 424609,
      "text": "我明天也会比较比较忙碌啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 425769,
      "end_ms": 427449,
      "text": "明天我比较忙碌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 431460,
      "end_ms": 432620,
      "text": "就很多巧合"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 434940,
      "end_ms": 437620,
      "text": "很多令人疑惑的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 438560,
      "end_ms": 440320,
      "text": "这东西算什么呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 441560,
      "end_ms": 443000,
      "text": "还不管这东西算什么了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 443000,
      "end_ms": 445160,
      "text": "反正这些"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 466800,
      "end_ms": 468600,
      "text": "嗯这不是奇迹"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 468600,
      "end_ms": 472120,
      "text": "这背后是有这个逻辑的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 473160,
      "end_ms": 475380,
      "text": "背后是有客观真理在运行的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 475380,
      "end_ms": 476520,
      "text": "与其说是奇迹"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 476520,
      "end_ms": 479520,
      "text": "不如说是这是真理和真相的显现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 479520,
      "end_ms": 481600,
      "text": "它是真理和真相的显现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 483720,
      "end_ms": 487190,
      "text": "我们会一齐啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 487190,
      "end_ms": 491790,
      "text": "和一起去把握住这些机会"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 491790,
      "end_ms": 496230,
      "text": "嗯虽然比较困难啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 496230,
      "end_ms": 499060,
      "text": "但总体来讲的话就是说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 508200,
      "end_ms": 512480,
      "text": "好不扯了不扯了不扯了不扯不扯不扯不扯了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 512808,
      "end_ms": 517049,
      "text": "就是我们远远比你们想象的要积极乐观的多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 517049,
      "end_ms": 522308,
